From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Willie Abrams <willie@pobox.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 14:06:55 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 11/19] kk: Add a passthrough GS for transform feedback

Use poly's passthrough GS to capture outputs when the application has no
GS. hk picks one at draw time; kk adds it during shader compilation,
before building the Metal pipelines.

The generated GS takes points, lines or triangles. Unroll adjacency
first, and keep the previous stage's output types for the Metal
vertex/fragment interface.

Assisted-by: Claude Code
---
